Question 2: Design a servlet to display “Welcome IP address of client” to first time visitor. Display Welcome-back IP address of client” if the user is revisiting the page. (Use Cookies) (Hint: Use req.getRemoteAddr() to get IP address of client)
Solution :- 
Code:-
import javax.servlet.*;
import javax.servlet.http.*;
import java.io.*;

public class ClientIPServlet extends HttpServlet {
    protected void doGet(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response) throws IOException {
        response.setContentType("text/html");
        String ip = request.getRemoteAddr();
        Cookie[] cookies = request.getCookies();
        boolean firstTime = true;
        if (cookies != null) {
            for (Cookie c : cookies) {
                if ("visited".equals(c.getName())) firstTime = false;
            }
        }
        PrintWriter out = response.getWriter();
        if (firstTime) {
            response.addCookie(new Cookie("visited", "yes"));
            out.println("Welcome IP address of client: " + ip);
        } else {
            out.println("Welcome-back IP address of client: " + ip);
        }
    }
}
Output :-
First visit: Welcome IP address of client
Return visit: Welcome-back IP address of client




